<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Foodmaker started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Foodmaker started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of Foodmaker Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- expects Foodmaker to earn $0.85 a share in fiscal 1997 and $1.05 a share in fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>-- expects Foodmaker's strong operating momentum to continue.</p>
<p>-- Foodmaker gained 1/4 to 15.</p>
</text>
